@startuml CyberSmart_Platform_Architecture

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam roundcorner 15
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam ArrowColor #2196F3
skinparam ArrowFontColor #1976D2
skinparam classFontStyle bold
skinparam classBorderColor #666666
skinparam packageTitleFontColor #0D47A1
skinparam packageTitleFontSize 16
skinparam packageBorderColor #BDBDBD

title **CyberSmart Platform - System Architecture**

' Switch to vertical layout
top to bottom direction

' === Phase I ===
package "Phase I - Data Collection" as Phase1{
  rectangle "• Baseline survey on awareness & habits\n• In-game actions (clicks, choices)\n• Password creation & reflection activities\n• Optional open-ended feedback" as P1
}

' === Phase II ===
package "Phase II - Data Processing & Validation" as Phase2{
  rectangle "• Validate data (check missing/inconsistent text)\n• Pseudonymization (replace personal info with tokens)\n• Normalize data (standardized scale)" as P2
}

' === Phase III ===
package "Phase III - Analytical Model Building" as Phase3{
  rectangle "• Feed processed data to model\n• Machine learning engine generates insights\n• Model outputs: Mastery Level & Difficulty Index\n• Feedback and refinement loop for improvement" as P3
}

' === Phase IV ===
package "Phase IV - Analytics & Reporting" as Phase4{
  rectangle "• Processed and scored data from ML model\n• Visualize data in dashboard\n• Modes: Pre/post assessment, Engagement dashboard, Strength by topic, Weakness by topic\n• Interactive analytics for users & admins\n• Track pre/post assessments scores and store in history" as P4
}

' === Phase V ===
package "Phase V - Governance & Security Operations" as Phase5{
  rectangle "• Security and compliance layer for data transmission (HTTPS)\n• Compliance checks (FERPA, IRS) alignment\n• Authentication & encryption layers" as P5
}

' === Phase VI ===
package "Phase VI - Continuous Learning Loop" as Phase6{
  rectangle "• Gather insights from feedback\n• Adaptive updates to models & content through auto-tuning difficulty levels\n• Personalized feedback & guidance\n• Educator guidance and feedback to ML engine" as P6
}

' === Arrows connecting phases vertically ===
P1 -down-> P2 : Clean & validated data
P2 -down-> P3 : Ready data for analysis
P3 -down-> P4 : Processed insights & results
P4 -down-> P5 : Secured reports & data storage
P5 -down-> P6 : Feedback & improvement actions
P6 -up-> P3 : Continuous improvement cycle

note bottom
The system moves through six phases — from data collection to continuous feedback —
creating a secure, adaptive learning environment for users.
end note

@enduml